cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release and the associated paper."
title: "Periodic Skyrmionium Transport"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-25
authors:
  - family-names: "Wong"
    given-names: "Cho-Chak"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-0287-0121"
abstract: >-
  A NumPy/SciPy implementation of magnetic-texture generation, Bloch-supercell
  band calculations, occupied-subspace Chern numbers, two-terminal recursive
  Green functions, four-terminal Landauer--Buttiker transport, disorder
  statistics, and finite-temperature convolution for periodic skyrmionium and
  skyrmion arrays.
keywords:
  - skyrmionium
  - magnetic superlattice
  - quantum transport
  - nonequilibrium Green function
  - topological Hall response
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yang-Fuping/periodic-skyrmionium-transport"
url: "https://github.com/Yang-Fuping/periodic-skyrmionium-transport"
license: MIT
